vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038080/extras/12312a5b0a1f129a9f0a23885835ecac.mp4?t=1772236290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038080/extras/b8136618b1fa6c043f39f30a78391e56.webp?t=1772236290\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Researchers have access to a specialized set of tools that can also be found during the mission:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geiger counters and gas detectors for anomaly detection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UV cameras for revealing hidden traces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lab kits for collecting and storing samples.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, beacons and lures for tactical control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity stabilizers, self-defense tools and auxiliary devices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All devices have practical applications and are integrated into the research workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038080/extras/198df5253f74337f611a615a617d6d04.poster.avif?t=1772236290\" width=1024 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038080/extras/198df5253f74337f611a615a617d6d04.webm?t=1772236290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038080/extras/198df5253f74337f611a615a617d6d04.mp4?t=1772236290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038080/extras/517d08cc499957883ba5b476f30e76e4.webp?t=1772236290\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each operative receives a Researcher Terminal, a special rank (S, A, B, C, D, E, F) and a unique specialization:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technician</strong>:\u00a0repairs and calibrates equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biologist:</strong>\u00a0analyzes samples and develops improvised solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Access Ops</strong>:\u00a0bypasses security systems and deciphers symbols.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Threat Response</strong>:\u00a0contains threats and protects the team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With progress, new tools, skills and functional capabilities become available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist and join our Discord to follow development, participate in playtests and take part in community giveaways.</strong></p>","developers":["Faceless Smile Corp."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038080/0e67c7487b900eb6bfc6aa36ede545dce61707d9/header.jpg?t=1772236290","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4038080/1054235511/afb32f8196e0d3f7110f15b2c8b73582c7c7926e/1762368964/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765112237","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4038080/1054235511/afb32f8196e0d3f7110f15b2c8b73582c7c7926e/1762368964/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765112237","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4038080/1054235511/afb32f8196e0d3f7110f15b2c8b73582c7c7926e/1762368964/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765112237","id":257227285,"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https